export anchor DriveInStyle:
    number: 363
    screen: VideoEditor
    name: Drive-in
    idea: A night at a drive-in, where the viewer is the big screen on its posts under a starry sky, a bulb lit marquee carries the title and Export, the bin is a row of parked cars with number plates, settings read like the snack bar board and tracks become parking lanes.
    base: dark
    palette:
        nightSky: #0a0f2c, sky, page and style sheet
        horizon: #1a1f4a, the sky gradient foot
        asphalt: #14151f, the lot under the screen
        lane: #1b1c28, parking lanes
        marqueeBoard: #1a1206, the marquee face behind the bulbs
        ink: #eef0ff, text
        moonlight: #c3c8ec, secondary text, ruler and car posts
        bulbYellow: #ffd36b, marquee title, timecode, title clips, the marker and selection
        neonTeal: #4ff0d2, video clips, transport rings, lot signs and focus
        neonPink: #ff6fa8, audio clips, the ticket booth, Export and the snack bar
        laneLine: #e0c25a, dashed lane and parking bay lines
        screenWhite: #d7dae8, the big screen frame
        plate: #f2ead2, number plates on the cars
    type:
        Marquee lettering uses a condensed display stack, Haettenschweiler,
        Impact, Arial Narrow Bold, Oswald, in caps. Body uses a geometric
        stack, Futura, Century Gothic, Avenir Next, Trebuchet MS, 15px at
        1.5. The marquee title is 46px, the timecode 26px tracked 0.06em in
        bulb yellow, lot signs 20px caps, snack board values 20px, number
        plates mono 11px bold.
    layout:
        The upper band is a starry night sky. On the left a marquee sign
        with a border of round warm bulbs reads Now showing in pink tracked
        caps, Launch teaser in big yellow glowing letters, 1080p and 24 fps
        with a star, and an italic a Brightwork Cut picture. Hanging beneath
        is a ticket booth with a pink top edge, an empty render bar, Render
        0% and reel not rolling, and a wide pink Export in marquee caps. On
        the right stands the big screen, a white framed picture on two posts
        with a cool glow, then the yellow timecode, round teal ringed
        transport buttons with a teal play and running time with the
        duration. The lower band is asphalt. Parked tonight, a teal lot
        sign, heads a row of five parked car silhouettes in dashed yellow
        bays, each with a cream number plate showing the file name and a
        post label with duration and picture or sound. On the right a pink
        neon Snack bar board lists Position 960 by 540, Scale 100 percent,
        Opacity 100 percent and Cross dissolve 12 frames with dotted leaders
        like prices. Parking lanes spans the full width, each track a dark
        lane edged by dashed yellow lines, with the id in yellow marquee
        letters, video clips outlined teal, audio pink, and the selected
        title clip filled bulb yellow with a double border, a glow and a
        star. A yellow diamond road sign reads cut to logo with a solid drop
        line, and a white playhead under a faint projector beam reads 18 s.
        At phone width the marquee stacks over the screen and the cars and
        snack board hide.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 40px page gutters, 28px between ground areas, 46px lanes.
    density: Medium low. One big screen, a marquee, five cars, a menu board and four lanes.
    corners: 14px marquee, 10px booth and board, 8px clip blocks, round transport buttons.
    borders: A ring of bulbs round the marquee, dashed yellow lane lines, 2px neon outlines on clips.
    shadows: Glows only. Warm round the marquee, cool round the screen, neon round Export.
    icons: Car silhouettes for media, filled transport glyphs, a diamond road sign for the marker and a star for the selection.
    focus: A 3px neon teal outline offset 3px.
    tone: Playful night out, such as Now showing, Parked tonight, Snack bar board and reel not rolling.
